{"id":416702,"date":"2026-10-30T17:42:37","date_gmt":"2026-10-30T15:42:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/?p=416702"},"modified":"2026-10-30T18:16:16","modified_gmt":"2026-10-30T16:16:16","slug":"video-activitate-inedita-pentru-elevii-de-toate-varstele-in-saptamana-verde-sau-scoala-altfel-la-cinema-city-ruleaza-documentarul-delta-salbatica-ulterior-la-clasa-elevii-pot-face-quiz-uri-cu-apl","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/video-activitate-inedita-pentru-elevii-de-toate-varstele-in-saptamana-verde-sau-scoala-altfel-la-cinema-city-ruleaza-documentarul-delta-salbatica-ulterior-la-clasa-elevii-pot-face-quiz-uri-cu-apl\/","title":{"rendered":"VIDEO Activitate inedit\u0103 pentru elevii de toate v\u00e2rstele, \u00een S\u0103pt\u0103m\u00e2na Verde sau \u0218coala Altfel: la Cinema City ruleaz\u0103 documentarul Delta S\u0103lbatic\u0103. Ulterior, la clas\u0103, elevii pot face quiz-uri cu aplica\u021bia dedicat\u0103 \/ Matei Tru\u021ba, produc\u0103torul filmului: informa\u021biile \u0219tiin\u021bifice sunt povestite \u00eentr-un mod simplu \u0219i accesibil, din perspectiva apei, narate de Medeea Marinescu"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h5 id=\"vizionarea-documentarului-delta-salbatica-la-cinema-impreuna-cu-colegii-de-clasa-poate-fi-o-activitate-inedita-pentru-profesorii-si-invatatorii-care-inca-mai-cauta-idei-pentru-saptamana-verde-sau-chi\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Vizionarea documentarului Delta S\u0103lbatic\u0103 la cinema, \u00eempreun\u0103 cu colegii de clas\u0103 poate fi o activitate inedit\u0103 pentru profesorii \u0219i \u00eenv\u0103\u021b\u0103torii care \u00eenc\u0103 mai caut\u0103 idei pentru S\u0103pt\u0103m\u00e2na Verde sau chiar \u0218coala Altfel. De ce este deosebit\u0103 activitatea? Pentru c\u0103 poate fi o experien\u021b\u0103 educativ\u0103 complet\u0103: de la elevi de clase primare, la cei de liceu, dup\u0103 vizionarea filmului pot discuta \u00een clas\u0103 pe marginea lui \u0219i pot explora prin quiz-uri \u00een <a href=\"https:\/\/www.romaniasalbatica.ro\/ro\/aplicatia-romania-salbatica\">aplica\u021bia Rom\u00e2nia S\u0103lbatic\u0103<\/a>. Interesant este faptul c\u0103 documentarul este narat din perspectiva apei cu vocea actri\u021bei Medeea Marinescu \u0219i prezint\u0103 Delta Dun\u0103rii \u00een toate anotimpurile. Cadrele didactice care aleg aceast\u0103 experien\u021b\u0103 cu elevii lor beneficiaz\u0103 de reduceri de grup prin programul educativ Cinema City.<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-1\">Delta S\u0103lbatic\u0103 este o poveste a tot ceea ce \u021bine de faun\u0103 \u0219i flor\u0103, mai mult sau mai pu\u021bin cunoscut\u0103 \u0219i face parte din cel mai mare proiect de fotografie \u0219i film documentar dedicat naturii din \u021bara noastr\u0103, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.romaniasalbatica.ro\/ro\">Rom\u00e2nia S\u0103lbatic\u0103<\/a>.  <\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-2\">Perioada programelor S\u0103pt\u0103m\u00e2na Verde sau \u0218coala Altfel nu este aceea\u0219i pentru toate unit\u0103\u021bile de \u00eenv\u0103\u021b\u0103m\u00e2nt. Fiecare \u0219coal\u0103 \u00ee\u0219i stabile\u0219te s\u0103pt\u0103m\u00e2na \u00een care organizeaz\u0103 programul, \u00een limitele structurii anului \u0219colar, dar \u00een general se ghideaz\u0103 \u00een perioade de dinaintea unei vacan\u021be sau dup\u0103. De luni, 2 noiembrie, re\u00eencepe \u0219coala \u0219i unele \u0219coli au ales aceast\u0103 perioada pentru activit\u0103\u021bi \u00een cadrul unui dintre programe<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\">\u00cen documentarul Delta S\u0103lbatic\u0103 elevii vor descoperi comportamente ale animalelor, vor \u00eenv\u0103\u021ba despre migra\u021bie, despre scopul \u0219i sensul stufului, al animalelor care tr\u0103iesc acolo. Toate informa\u021biile din film sunt verificate cu speciali\u0219ti, biologi \u0219i exper\u021bi \u00een conservare. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4 wp-block-paragraph\">\u201ePe l\u00e2ng\u0103 faptul c\u0103 sunt spuse pove\u0219tile naturii din Delt\u0103, filmul este pl\u0103cut vizual, sonor, sunt ni\u0219te pove\u0219ti spectaculoase \u0219i, \u00een acela\u0219i timp, livr\u0103m ni\u0219te informa\u021bii \u0219tiin\u021bifice foarte clare, dar \u00eentr-un mod simplu \u0219i accesibil&#8221;, spune Matei Tru\u021ba, produc\u0103torul filmului documentar.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-5 wp-block-paragraph\">Documentarul este pentru toate v\u00e2rstele. \u201eCei mici o s\u0103 fie mai degrab\u0103 captiva\u021bi de pove\u0219tile anim\u0103lu\u021belor, s\u0103 fie atra\u0219i emo\u021bional \u0219i curio\u0219i de ce pot vedea din via\u021ba animalelor din Delt\u0103. Elevii de liceu ar putea s\u0103 dezvolte o pasiune pentru fotografie sau film documentar sau conservare, deja deja o s\u0103 aib\u0103 o perspectiv\u0103 mai proactiv\u0103, dup\u0103 ce vizioneaz\u0103 filmul&#8221;, spune Matei Tru\u021ba.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"alignright size-large is-resized\"><img  loading=\"lazy\"  decoding=\"async\"  width=\"1024\"  height=\"682\"  src=\"data:image\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABAQMAAAAl21bKAAAAA1BMVEUAAP+KeNJXAAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAlwSFlzAAAOxAAADsQBlSsOGwAAAApJREFUCNdjYAAAAAIAAeIhvDMAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\"  alt=\"\"  class=\"wp-image-416795 pk-lazyload\"  style=\"aspect-ratio:1.501506672406371;width:413px;height:auto\"  data-pk-sizes=\"auto\"  data-ls-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"  data-pk-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Voiceover-Medeea-Marinescu-03-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x682.jpg\"  data-pk-srcset=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Voiceover-Medeea-Marinescu-03-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Voiceover-Medeea-Marinescu-03-\u00a9-DanDinu-300x200-1.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Voiceover-Medeea-Marinescu-03-\u00a9-DanDinu-767x511.jpg 767w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Voiceover-Medeea-Marinescu-03-\u00a9-DanDinu-389x259.jpg 389w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Voiceover-Medeea-Marinescu-03-\u00a9-DanDinu-820x546.jpg 820w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Voiceover-Medeea-Marinescu-03-\u00a9-DanDinu-80x53-2.jpg 80w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Voiceover-Medeea-Marinescu-03-\u00a9-DanDinu-1180x786.jpg 1180w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Voiceover-Medeea-Marinescu-03-\u00a9-DanDinu-150x100.jpg 150w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Voiceover-Medeea-Marinescu-03-\u00a9-DanDinu-779x519.jpg 779w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Voiceover-Medeea-Marinescu-03-\u00a9-DanDinu-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Voiceover-Medeea-Marinescu-03-\u00a9-DanDinu.jpg 1220w\" ><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6 wp-block-paragraph\">Actri\u021ba Medeea Marinescu este cea care nareaz\u0103 documentarul, este vocea apei care spune povestea filmului, iar c\u00e2nt\u0103rea\u021ba Irina Rimes interpreteaz\u0103 melodia principal\u0103 de pe coloana sonor\u0103, o pies\u0103 cu accente de folclor local.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h5 id=\"ce-trebuie-sa-stie-profesorii\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ce trebuie s\u0103 \u0219tie profesorii<\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7 wp-block-paragraph\">\u201eGrupurile de elevi al\u0103turi de profesori \u0219i \u00eenv\u0103\u021b\u0103tori se pot \u00eenscrie la vizionarea filmului \u00een cadrul programelor S\u0103pt\u0103m\u00e2na Verde sau \u0218coala Altfel \u0219i vor primi o bro\u0219ur\u0103 educativ\u0103 pe care am preg\u0103tit-o special. Pe l\u00e2ng\u0103 o recapitulare a importan\u021bei apei \u0219i a Deltei, ofer\u0103 \u0219i c\u00e2teva jocule\u021be sau teme de discu\u021bie la sala de clas\u0103, ulterior&#8221;, spune produc\u0103torul filmului. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8 wp-block-paragraph\">Este necesar\u0103 o rezervare pentru o proiec\u021bie a filmului Delta S\u0103lbatic\u0103. Acestea sunt organizate la Cinema City \u00een mai multe ora\u0219e. Profesorul poate solicita o anumit\u0103 or\u0103 pentru grupul de elevi \u0219i va beneficia de:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Bilete de grup la pre\u021buri speciale;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bro\u0219ur\u0103 educa\u021bional\u0103 \u00een format electronic;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bilete gratuite pentru un profesorul \u00eenso\u021bitor sau alt supervizor al grupului;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Op\u021biunea de a acomoda proiec\u021bii speciale, \u00een intervalul dorit, inclusiv la matinal.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Pentru rezerv\u0103ri: <\/strong>mail la adresa <a href=\"mailto:education@cinemacity.ro\">education@cinemacity.ro<\/a> sau <a href=\"mailto:sebastian.nicolescu@cinemacity.ro\">sebastian.nicolescu@cinemacity.ro<\/a> cu urm\u0103toarele detalii:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Num\u0103rul de elevi \u0219i al adul\u021bilor care \u00eei \u00eenso\u021besc (profesorii);<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ora\u0219ul \u0219i loca\u021bia Cinema City;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Intervalul orar preferat pentru vizionare Delta S\u0103lbatic\u0103.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h5 id=\"de-ce-este-inedit-documentarul\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">De ce este inedit documentarul <\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9 wp-block-paragraph\">Documentarul Delta S\u0103lbatic\u0103 este cel mai complex documentar rom\u00e2nesc despre Delta Dun\u0103rii. A fost realizat pe parcursul a 5 ani de aceea\u0219i echip\u0103 care a stat \u00een spatele proiectului Rom\u00e2nia S\u0103lbatic\u0103. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-10 wp-block-paragraph\">\u201eE un documentar pentru toate v\u00e2rstele, de la copii de clase primare p\u00e2n\u0103 la liceeni. Are o structur\u0103 clasic\u0103, dar <strong>inov\u0103m prin prisma faptului c\u0103 povestea e spus\u0103 din perspectiva apei, urm\u0103re\u0219te Delta Dun\u0103rii prin toate anotimpurile \u0219i este o \u00eenl\u0103n\u021buire de micropove\u0219ti \u00een care vedem cum diverse specii de mamifere, de p\u0103s\u0103ri fac fa\u021ba locurilor<\/strong>&#8222;, spune Matei Tru\u021ba, produc\u0103torul filmului documentar.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img  loading=\"lazy\"  decoding=\"async\"  width=\"1024\"  height=\"682\"  src=\"data:image\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAABAAAAAKqAQMAAACehL5yAAAAA1BMVEUAAP+KeNJXAAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAlwSFlzAAAOxAAADsQBlSsOGwAAAGtJREFUeNrtwQEBAAAAgiD\/r25IQAEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC8G1e5AAGKa6yjAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC\"  alt=\"\"  class=\"wp-image-416765 pk-lazyload\"  data-pk-sizes=\"auto\"  data-ls-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"  data-pk-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Subacvatic-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x682.jpg\"  data-pk-srcset=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Subacvatic-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Subacvatic-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-300x200-1.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Subacvatic-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-767x511.jpg 767w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Subacvatic-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-389x259.jpg 389w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Subacvatic-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-820x546.jpg 820w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Subacvatic-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-80x53-2.jpg 80w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Subacvatic-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1180x786.jpg 1180w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Subacvatic-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-150x100.jpg 150w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Subacvatic-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-779x519.jpg 779w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Subacvatic-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Subacvatic-04-\u00a9-DanDinu.jpg 1220w\" ><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Foto: Rom\u00e2nia S\u0103lbatic\u0103<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img  loading=\"lazy\"  decoding=\"async\"  width=\"1024\"  height=\"684\"  src=\"data:image\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAABAAAAAKsAQMAAABI3V1vAAAAA1BMVEUAAP+KeNJXAAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAlwSFlzAAAOxAAADsQBlSsOGwAAAGtJREFUeNrtwQEBAAAAgiD\/r25IQAEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADwbli7AAGYJM0zAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC\"  alt=\"\"  class=\"wp-image-416777 pk-lazyload\"  data-pk-sizes=\"auto\"  data-ls-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"  data-pk-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Brotacel-01-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x684.jpg\"  data-pk-srcset=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Brotacel-01-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Brotacel-01-\u00a9-DanDinu-300x200-1.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Brotacel-01-\u00a9-DanDinu-768x513.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Brotacel-01-\u00a9-DanDinu-389x260.jpg 389w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Brotacel-01-\u00a9-DanDinu-820x548.jpg 820w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Brotacel-01-\u00a9-DanDinu-1180x788.jpg 1180w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Brotacel-01-\u00a9-DanDinu-80x53-2.jpg 80w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Brotacel-01-\u00a9-DanDinu-150x100.jpg 150w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Brotacel-01-\u00a9-DanDinu-780x521.jpg 780w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Brotacel-01-\u00a9-DanDinu-600x401.jpg 600w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Brotacel-01-\u00a9-DanDinu.jpg 1220w\" ><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Foto: Rom\u00e2nia S\u0103lbatic\u0103<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img  loading=\"lazy\"  decoding=\"async\"  width=\"1024\"  height=\"682\"  src=\"data:image\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAABAAAAAKqAQMAAACehL5yAAAAA1BMVEUAAP+KeNJXAAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAlwSFlzAAAOxAAADsQBlSsOGwAAAGtJREFUeNrtwQEBAAAAgiD\/r25IQAEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC8G1e5AAGKa6yjAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC\"  alt=\"\"  class=\"wp-image-416799 pk-lazyload\"  data-pk-sizes=\"auto\"  data-ls-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"  data-pk-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Codalb-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x682.jpg\"  data-pk-srcset=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Codalb-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Codalb-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-300x200-1.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Codalb-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-767x511.jpg 767w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Codalb-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-389x259.jpg 389w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Codalb-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-820x546.jpg 820w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Codalb-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-80x53-2.jpg 80w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Codalb-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-1180x786.jpg 1180w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Codalb-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-150x100.jpg 150w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Codalb-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-779x519.jpg 779w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Codalb-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Codalb-02-\u00a9-DanDinu.jpg 1220w\" ><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Foto: Rom\u00e2nia S\u0103lbatic\u0103<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img  loading=\"lazy\"  decoding=\"async\"  width=\"1024\"  height=\"684\"  src=\"data:image\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAABAAAAAKsAQMAAABI3V1vAAAAA1BMVEUAAP+KeNJXAAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAlwSFlzAAAOxAAADsQBlSsOGwAAAGtJREFUeNrtwQEBAAAAgiD\/r25IQAEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADwbli7AAGYJM0zAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC\"  alt=\"\"  class=\"wp-image-416800 pk-lazyload\"  data-pk-sizes=\"auto\"  data-ls-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"  data-pk-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nufar-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x684.jpg\"  data-pk-srcset=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nufar-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nufar-\u00a9-DanDinu-768x513.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nufar-\u00a9-DanDinu-300x200-1.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nufar-\u00a9-DanDinu-389x260.jpg 389w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nufar-\u00a9-DanDinu-820x548.jpg 820w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nufar-\u00a9-DanDinu-80x53-2.jpg 80w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nufar-\u00a9-DanDinu-1180x788.jpg 1180w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nufar-\u00a9-DanDinu-150x100.jpg 150w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nufar-\u00a9-DanDinu-780x521.jpg 780w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nufar-\u00a9-DanDinu-600x401.jpg 600w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nufar-\u00a9-DanDinu.jpg 1220w\" ><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-11 wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/romaniasalbatica.ro\/ro\/echipa\/matei-truta\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Matei<\/a> lucreaz\u0103 \u00een domeniul cinematografiei de aproape 10 ani, \u0219i este unul dintre produc\u0103torii documentarului Rom\u00e2nia S\u0103lbatic\u0103, precum \u0219i produc\u0103tor al filmului de making of Povestea Rom\u00e2nia S\u0103lbatic\u0103. A lucrat ca director la Transilvania Film, precum \u0219i pentru Festivalul Interna\u021bional de Film Transilvania (TIFF). <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-12 wp-block-paragraph\">Au fost filmate filmat 13.000 de cadre care \u00eensumeaz\u0103 peste 48 de ore pentru documentarul Delta S\u0103lbatic\u0103.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-13 wp-block-paragraph\">\u201eS-au filmat 162 de zile pe teren \u0219i ce ne-am propus cu acest film, \u0219i p\u00e2n\u0103 acum pare c\u0103 am \u0219i reu\u0219it s\u0103 facem, este s\u0103 ar\u0103t\u0103m Delta Dun\u0103rii, a\u0219a cum majoritatea nu o \u0219tiu. Pentru cei care nu au descoperit Delta Dun\u0103rii, o s\u0103 fie fascina\u021bi de biodiversitatea \u0219i bog\u0103\u021bia de acolo. Pentru cei care \u0219tiu Delta Dun\u0103rii, cu siguran\u021b\u0103 o s\u0103 vad\u0103 ni\u0219te de laturi sau ni\u0219te pove\u0219ti pe care nici ei nu le b\u0103nuiau. Au primit chiar feedback de la diver\u0219i oameni care au v\u0103zut filmul, \u0219i ne-au spus c\u0103 de\u0219i merg de mul\u021bi ani \u00een Delt\u0103, nu au v\u0103zut-o niciodat\u0103 a\u0219a cum am prezentat-o noi&#8221;, spune produc\u0103torul filmului. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-14 wp-block-paragraph\">\u201e\u00cen filmele noastre prezent\u0103m \u00een general, \u00een frumuse\u021bea naturii, \u00een documentarul Rom\u00e2nia S\u0103lbatic\u0103 nu am ar\u0103tat oameni deloc \u00een Delta S\u0103lbatic\u0103. O s\u0103 fie o prezen\u021b\u0103 uman\u0103 doar la final. Este o experien\u021b\u0103 imersiv\u0103 a apei ca element d\u0103t\u0103tor de via\u021b\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 \u00eenceput, f\u0103r\u0103 sf\u00e2r\u0219it, \u0219i a vie\u021bii, biodiversit\u0103\u021bii \u0219i ecosistemelor pe care ea le creeaz\u0103 pe parcursul anotimpurilor. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u0218i <strong>este o poveste foarte interesant\u0103, pentru c\u0103 chiar a\u0219a \u00eencepe, filmul spune cum \u00eent\u00e2lnirea dintre munte \u0219i mare se face \u00een secret \u0219i este facilitat\u0103 practic de ap\u0103, de fluviul Dun\u0103rea, care ia minerale din de pe munte, din r\u00e2urile care se vars\u0103 \u00een ea \u0219i, \u00eentr-un final, le duce p\u00e2n\u0103 la Marea Neagr\u0103<\/strong>&#8222;, poveste\u0219te Matei. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img  loading=\"lazy\"  decoding=\"async\"  width=\"1024\"  height=\"682\"  src=\"data:image\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAABAAAAAKqAQMAAACehL5yAAAAA1BMVEUAAP+KeNJXAAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAlwSFlzAAAOxAAADsQBlSsOGwAAAGtJREFUeNrtwQEBAAAAgiD\/r25IQAEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC8G1e5AAGKa6yjAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC\"  alt=\"\"  class=\"wp-image-416760 pk-lazyload\"  data-pk-sizes=\"auto\"  data-ls-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"  data-pk-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Canal-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1-1024x682.jpg\"  data-pk-srcset=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Canal-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Canal-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1-300x200-1.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Canal-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1-767x511.jpg 767w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Canal-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1-389x259.jpg 389w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Canal-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1-80x53-2.jpg 80w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Canal-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1-820x546.jpg 820w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Canal-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1-1180x786.jpg 1180w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Canal-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1-150x100.jpg 150w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Canal-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1-779x519.jpg 779w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Canal-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Canal-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1.jpg 1220w\" ><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Foto: Rom\u00e2nia S\u0103lbatic\u0103<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img  loading=\"lazy\"  decoding=\"async\"  width=\"1024\"  height=\"682\"  src=\"data:image\/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAABAAAAAKqAQMAAACehL5yAAAAA1BMVEUAAP+KeNJXAAAAAXRSTlMAQObYZgAAAAlwSFlzAAAOxAAADsQBlSsOGwAAAGtJREFUeNrtwQEBAAAAgiD\/r25IQAEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAC8G1e5AAGKa6yjAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC\"  alt=\"\"  class=\"wp-image-416766 pk-lazyload\"  data-pk-sizes=\"auto\"  data-ls-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"  data-pk-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Lac-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x682.jpg\"  data-pk-srcset=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Lac-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Lac-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-300x200-1.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Lac-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-767x511.jpg 767w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Lac-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-389x259.jpg 389w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Lac-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-820x546.jpg 820w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Lac-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-80x53-2.jpg 80w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Lac-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-1180x786.jpg 1180w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Lac-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-150x100.jpg 150w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Lac-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-779x519.jpg 779w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Lac-04-\u00a9-DanDinu-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Lac-04-\u00a9-DanDinu.jpg 1220w\" ><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Foto: Rom\u00e2nia S\u0103lbatic\u0103<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img  loading=\"lazy\"  decoding=\"async\"  width=\"1024\"  height=\"682\"  src=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Vegetatie-ripariana-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-80x53.jpg\"  alt=\"\"  class=\"wp-image-416768 pk-lqip pk-lazyload\"  data-pk-sizes=\"auto\"  data-ls-sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"  data-pk-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Vegetatie-ripariana-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x682.jpg\"  data-pk-srcset=\"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Vegetatie-ripariana-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Vegetatie-ripariana-02-\u00a9-DanDinu-300x200-1.jpg 300w, https:\/\